(c) offering a paid hosted or white-label version of the project; or
(d) carrying out any of the above with a modified version or a different name.

For example, including this project with a manufacturer's commercially
offered ovens requires prior written permission; using it to operate a
business's own oven does not. A free download does not permit later resale.
Genuinely optional donations for non-commercial sharing or development,
without a required payment or paid benefit, are not a sale. A donation does
not grant commercial exploitation rights.

Commercial terms must be agreed separately in writing before the activity
begins. Contact Thomas Eigner through the relevant repository's GitHub
